    "statement": "This contract was transcribed by hand from the rendered VCF Automation xAPIs reference pages on developer.broadcom.com. Its source is reference documentation, not a published API specification. VCF Automation ships no specification in VMware's Apache-2.0 vmware/vcf-api-specs repository, whose specifications/ tree covers only fleet-lcm, nsx, sddc-lcm, sddc-manager, vcf-installer, vcf-operations, vsan-data-protection and vsphere. Every statement below is a transcription of a rendered reference page recorded in docs/official_sources.json and carries the fidelity limits of a rendered page.",
